SEC. 7. Definition of Terms. – As used in this Act:

(a) Compensation refers to the basic pay or salary received by an officer or employee of the OWWA, pursuant to the official appointment, excluding per diems, bonuses, overtime pay, honoraria, allowances and any other emoluments received that are not integrated into the basic pay under existing laws;

(b) Contribution or membership fee refers to the amount paid to the OWWA by the employer or by an OFW in accordance with the provisions of this Act;

(c) Dependent refers to any of the following:

(1) The legal spouse;

(c) Dependent refers to any of the following:

